[I] MiniSSDP Daemon

[T] MiniSSDPd is a daemon that keeps track of all UPnP devices announcing
[T] themselves on the network, so that local processes can query them
[T] quickly through a unix socket. It also lets several local UPnP servers
[T] share the SSDP port.

[U] http://miniupnp.free.fr/minissdpd.html

[A] Minissdpd Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

